{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>ונטיתי</b> — שאר הבעל: the body of Baal. And R. Moses the Kohen said: like שאר יעקב (the remnant of Jacob)." "<b>עם הכהנים</b> — they are the ministers, for thus the word כל כהן (every kohen), and bear witness: וכהנו לי (and they shall minister to Me)."], :book :zephaniah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zephaniah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zfanya"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:47:12.278669976Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}